<span class="line"><span style="color:#7F848E;font-style:italic;"> * </span><span style="color:#C678DD;font-style:italic;">@note</span><span style="color:#7F848E;font-style:italic;"> If the query uses the table model, the cast should be TableResultSet</span></span>
